      ],
      "image": "assets/images/14415/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "While the eggs are cooking, place bacon in a large, deep skillet. Cook over medium-high heat until evenly brown, 7 to 10 minutes. Drain, crumble, and set aside.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/iB7ZnIiVx6zYDjw51LE_Xs-eAOk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/14415-cobb-salad-ddmfs-step-2-0225-3x4-0864c3c5a0de4c0aae440966d97fbbf3.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/14415/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Divide shredded lettuce among individual plates. Arrange rows of bacon, eggs, chicken, tomatoes, blue cheese, green onions, and avocado on top.",
